gpui-component 0.8.1
Upstream: https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit
License: Apache-2.0; the upstream LICENSE-APACHE is distributed with gpui-component.

Newport modifies gpui-component for key event constructors for GPUI's added key
fields, dialog identity and focus restoration, menu focus, choices tracked by
value, explicit control sizes, exact text selection copies and the search
panel's first keystroke. The changed files are src/attachment.rs,
src/button/button.rs, src/button/button_group.rs,
src/button/dropdown_button.rs, src/button/toggle.rs, src/carousel/carousel.rs,
src/checkbox.rs, src/combobox.rs, src/input/editor.rs, src/input/input.rs,
src/input/overlay.rs, src/input/textarea.rs, src/lib.rs, src/list/list.rs,
src/menu/dropdown_menu.rs, src/menu/popup_menu.rs, src/pagination.rs,
src/questionnaire/components.rs, src/root.rs, src/searchable_list/adapter.rs,
src/searchable_list/state.rs, src/select.rs, src/switch.rs, src/tab/tab.rs,
src/tab/tab_bar.rs, src/window_ext.rs and
tests/integration/controlled_change_callbacks.rs. All other published package
files remain unchanged.
